---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Insights | Swishtag';
const description = 'Practical thinking on Shopify, company stores, promotional products, integrations, automation and modern commerce systems.';
const canonical = 'https://swishtag.com/insights/';
const robots = 'index,follow';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} robots={robots}>
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/insights.css" />

  <main class="insights-page">
    <section class="insights-hero">
      <div class="orbit-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orbit-ring"></div><div class="orbit-dot a"></div><div class="orbit-dot b"></div><div class="orbit-rocket">-&gt;</div>
      </div>
      <div class="container insights-container hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">SWISHTAG INSIGHTS</div>
        <h1>Ideas for better commerce.</h1>
        <p>Practical thinking on Shopify, company stores, promotional products, integrations, automation and the systems behind modern commerce.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container insights-container toolbar" aria-label="Insight filters">
      <div class="category-scroll">
        <button class="filter-pill active" data-filter="all">All</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="shopify">Shopify</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="company-stores">Company Stores</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="promotional-products">Promotional Products</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="automation">Automation</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="integrations">Integrations</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="migration">Migration</button>
        <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="commerce">Commerce</button>
      </div>
      <label class="search-box">
        <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2315;</span>
        <input id="insight-search" type="search" placeholder="Search insights..." aria-label="Search insights">
      </label>
    </section>

    <section class="container insights-container featured-wrap">
      <a class="featured-card" data-wp-featured-card data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="featured-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="window"><div class="window-top"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="window-body"><div class="window-kicker"></div><div class="window-title"></div><div class="window-title short"></div><div class="window-chart"></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="featured-content">
          <div class="eyebrow">MIGRATION</div>
          <h2>Shopify Migration Checklist: 12 Steps for 2026</h2>
          <p>A practical checklist for moving products, customers, SEO, orders and operations to Shopify without creating unnecessary problems.</p>
          <div class="meta"><span>August 3, 2026</span><span>8 min read</span></div>
          <span class="text-link">Read insight <span class="arrow">-&gt;</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="container insights-container latest-section">
      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">LATEST</div><h2>Latest insights</h2><p>Useful ideas for teams building, moving and automating commerce.</p></div></div>
      <div class="article-grid" data-wp-posts-grid aria-live="polite">
        <article class="article-card" data-category="migration"><a data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><div class="article-image"><div class="art a"></div></div><div class="card-category">Migration</div><h3>Shopify Checkout Migration Guide: All Steps, Cost & Tips</h3><p>What changes during checkout migration, what should stay untouched, and where projects usually go wrong.</p><div class="card-bottom"><div class="meta"><span>Jul 29</span><span>7 min</span></div><span class="card-arrow">-&gt;</span></div></a></article>
        <article class="article-card" data-category="migration"><a data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><div class="article-image"><div class="art b"></div></div><div class="card-category">Migration</div><h3>Shopify SEO Migration Guide 2026: Protect Your Rankings</h3><p>A practical framework for redirects, metadata, internal links and search visibility before launch day.</p><div class="card-bottom"><div class="meta"><span>Jul 24</span><span>9 min</span></div><span class="card-arrow">-&gt;</span></div></a></article>
        <article class="article-card" data-category="shopify"><a data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><div class="article-image"><div class="art c"></div></div><div class="card-category">Shopify</div><h3>How to Choose a Shopify Migration Agency</h3><p>Questions that quickly expose whether an agency understands architecture, data and operations, not only design.</p><div class="card-bottom"><div class="meta"><span>Jul 20</span><span>6 min</span></div><span class="card-arrow">-&gt;</span></div></a></article>
        <article class="article-card" data-category="promotional-products"><a data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><div class="article-image"><div class="art d"></div></div><div class="card-category">Promotional Products</div><h3>Migrating to Shopify POS: A Guide for Promo Brands in 2026</h3><p>How promotional product businesses can connect retail activity, catalogs and customer data without creating duplicate systems.</p><div class="card-bottom"><div class="meta"><span>Jul 15</span><span>8 min</span></div><span class="card-arrow">-&gt;</span></div></a></article>
        <article class="article-card" data-category="commerce"><a data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><div class="article-image"><div class="art e"></div></div><div class="card-category">Commerce</div><h3>The Future of Promotional Product E-commerce Platforms</h3><p>Why the next generation of promo commerce will be more connected, composable and automation-first.</p><div class="card-bottom"><div class="meta"><span>Jul 10</span><span>10 min</span></div><span class="card-arrow">-&gt;</span></div></a></article>
        <article class="article-card" data-category="automation"><a data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><div class="article-image"><div class="art f"></div></div><div class="card-category">Automation</div><h3>7 Ways to Improve Order Fulfillment for Custom Products</h3><p>Reduce handoffs, status chasing and production errors by designing a cleaner fulfillment workflow.</p><div class="card-bottom"><div class="meta"><span>Jul 7</span><span>5 min</span></div><span class="card-arrow">-&gt;</span></div></a></article>
        <article class="article-card" data-category="shopify"><a data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><div class="article-image"><div class="art g"></div></div><div class="card-category">Shopify</div><h3>Shopify Customer Migration for B2B & Promo Brands</h3><p>Customer records are simple until price lists, permissions, locations and account history enter the picture.</p><div class="card-bottom"><div class="meta"><span>Jul 2</span><span>8 min</span></div><span class="card-arrow">-&gt;</span></div></a></article>
        <article class="article-card" data-category="company-stores"><a data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><div class="article-image"><div class="art h"></div></div><div class="card-category">Company Stores</div><h3>Complete Guide to Promotional Product Order Management</h3><p>From client storefront to supplier handoff, understand the systems that keep multi-store programs under control.</p><div class="card-bottom"><div class="meta"><span>Jun 28</span><span>11 min</span></div><span class="card-arrow">-&gt;</span></div></a></article>
        <article class="article-card" data-category="integrations"><a data-loading-link aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><div class="article-image"><div class="art i"></div></div><div class="card-category">Integrations</div><h3>How Shopify Integrations Improve Promotional Product Workflows</h3><p>Where integrations actually remove work, and where adding another connector can make operations worse.</p><div class="card-bottom"><div class="meta"><span>Jun 23</span><span>7 min</span></div><span class="card-arrow">-&gt;</span></div></a></article>
      </div>
      <div class="load-row"><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-wp-load-more>Load more insights</button></div>
    </section>

    <section class="editor-pick">
      <div class="container insights-container">
        <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">EDITOR'S PICK</div><h2>Worth your time.</h2></div></div>
        <div class="editor-grid">
          <a class="pick-card large" href="/enterprise-shopify-automation/"><div><div class="card-category">Company Stores</div><h3>When one company store becomes fifty, the operating model has to change.</h3></div><div class="meta"><span>Enterprise guide</span><span>12 min read</span></div></a>
          <a class="pick-card" href="/shopify-sage-connect-integration/"><div><div class="card-category">Integrations</div><h3>When should Shopify connect to SAGE?</h3></div><div class="meta"><span>7 min read</span></div></a>
          <a class="pick-card" href="/insights/blog/?slug=improve-custom-product-order-fulfillment"><div><div class="card-category">Automation</div><h3>Stop automating broken workflows.</h3></div><div class="meta"><span>5 min read</span></div></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container insights-container cta-section">
      <div class="cta-panel"><div class="eyebrow">READY TO BUILD?</div><h2>Turn the idea into something real.</h2><p>From Shopify company stores to custom automation, Swishtag helps commerce teams build systems that remove manual work and scale properly.</p><div class="cta-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/shopify-solutions/">Explore solutions</a></div></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script slot="scripts" is:inline src="/assets/insights.js?v=20260817-loading-links"></script>
</BaseLayout>
